Trossen Dataset Viewer

Forked from the Hugging Face Space `lerobot/visualize_dataset`
(https://huggingface.co/spaces/lerobot/visualize_dataset), which is licensed
under the Apache License 2.0. The original LeRobot episode viewer is the base of
the dataset pages in src/app/[org]/[dataset]/.

Everything added since — the local dataset index and file server
(serve_datasets.py), the MCAP inspector, depth and video previews, the review
workflow, the validation-tool runner and the Docker packaging — is part of this
repository and is offered under the same license.
